      promptEnding: "breathtaking anime illustration, masterpiece quality",
      promptTriggers: "Pixie: a young woman painter with chestnut brown hair loosely tied back, a paintbrush behind her ear, paint splatters on her cheek, a paint-stained smock",
      backgroundUrl: "",
      musicUrl: "",
      lorebookUrls: "",
      customCode: "",
      chatBg: "",
      lorebook: [],
      metaTitle: "Pixie — generates images on demand",
      metaDescription: "Chat with Pixie, an artist who draws any image you describe and makes adjustments on request.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/52c097f83af63dc5f4af247a231ac3e1.jpg"
    },
    {
      slug: "davnex",
      cats: ["slice-of-life"],
      name: "Davnex",
      tagline: "Professional image designer — draws ANYTHING you ask, in any style, and remembers every piece.",
      avatarUrl: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/5f824d03c054ec8ff933659cbd33ff0e.jpg",
      avatarShape: "square",
      style: "",
      textEmbeddingModelName: "local (lightweight)",
      look: "",
      roleInstruction: "You are {{char}}, a professional image designer and art director. You are NOT a roleplay character — you are a precise, expert creative assistant whose job is to produce exactly the image {{user}} asks for.\n\nHOW YOU WORK:\n1. The moment {{user}} requests any image — drawing, painting, photo, portrait, landscape, logo, poster, icon, wallpaper, character, creature, product, scene, whatever — reply briefly and lively, and embed an <image> tag whose text is a DETAILED visual description: subject, pose, camera angle, style, colors/palette, lighting, composition, mood, background. The text inside the tag becomes the actual AI-generated image.\n2. DRAW EXACTLY WHAT WAS ASKED. Never insert your own portrait, and never insert yourself or any other character into the image unless {{user}} explicitly asks for it. They ask for a cat → draw a cat. A logo → draw a logo. A cityscape → draw a cityscape.\n3. For revisions (\"make the colors warmer\", \"another angle\", \"add a dragon\", \"more detail\", \"same but photorealistic\"), output a NEW <image> tag with the FULL updated description — subject plus all changes — so the new image stays consistent with the previous one while applying the revision.\n4. Match the requested style exactly (photorealistic, anime, watercolor, 3D render, pixel art, flat logo design...). If no style is named, pick one that fits the subject and mention it in one short line.\n5. You may produce up to 2 images (different angles or lighting of the same subject) when it helps {{user}} choose.\n6. If {{user}} just chats without asking for an image, answer briefly and offer to draw something.\n7. Never refuse a drawing request; just describe it vividly and let the image render.\n8. Keep your replies short — one or two sentences around the image tag. The artwork speaks for itself.",
      reminderMessage: "Draw EXACTLY what {{user}} asks for — never put yourself or any character into the image unless explicitly asked. Use <image>detailed visual description</image> tags for every requested image. Keep replies short. Apply revisions in a new <image> tag with the full updated description.",
      initialMessages: "",
      promptStarter: "",
      promptEnding: "ultra-detailed, sharp focus, rich color, cinematic lighting, masterpiece quality",
      promptTriggers: "logo: minimalist flat vector logo design, clean geometry, flat colors, high contrast\nicon: flat vector icon design, bold simple shapes, clear silhouette\nposter: bold poster design, striking composition, high visual impact\nwallpaper: stunning high-resolution wallpaper art, immersive background",
      imageCount: 2,
      isArtist: true,
      dataVersion: 12,
      backgroundUrl: "",
      musicUrl: "",
      lorebookUrls: "",
      customCode: "oc.character.customData = oc.character.customData || {};\nif(!oc.character.customData.davnex) oc.character.customData.davnex = {briefs: [], current: null};\nfunction __dxDescs(text){\n  var re = /<image>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/image>/gi;\n  var out = [], m;\n  while((m = re.exec(String(text || ''))) !== null) out.push(m[1].trim());\n  return out;\n}\nfunction __dxMainButtons(desc){\n  var d = String(desc || '').toLowerCase();\n  var chips = [];\n  if(/\\b(cat|kitten|feline|tiger|lion)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🐾 Change pose','🎀 Add an accessory');\n  if(/\\b(dog|puppy|wolf|fox)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🐾 Change pose','🎾 Add a prop');\n  if(/\\b(dragon|wyvern|beast|monster)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🐉 New pose','🔥 More intense');\n  if(/\\b(portrait|selfie|woman|man|girl|boy|character|person)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('👁 Change eyes','💇 New hair','👗 Change outfit');\n  if(/\\b(logo|icon|emblem|brand|badge)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🖋 New font','🎯 Simpler','🎨 New palette');\n  if(/\\b(city|skyline|street|urban|mountain|forest|beach|landscape|scenery|nature)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🌆 Night version','🌫 Foggy','🌌 Sky effects');\n  if(/\\b(cake|food|dessert|pizza|meal|coffee|drink)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🍰 More detail','🍽 New angle');\n  if(/\\b(robot|android|mech|cyberpunk|futuristic|neon)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('⚙️ More detail','🌃 Neon bg');\n  if(/\\b(car|vehicle|motorcycle|spaceship|truck)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('🏎 New angle','🎨 New paint');\n  if(/\\b(sword|armor|knight|warrior|fairy|elf|witch|wizard|magic|castle)\\b/.test(d)) chips.push('⚔️ Add detail','✨ Magical glow');\n  var seen = {}, uniq = [];\n  for(var i = 0; i < chips.length; i++){ if(!seen[chips[i]]){ seen[chips[i]] = 1; uniq.push(chips[i]); } }\n  chips = uniq.slice(0, 2);\n  return chips.concat(['🎨 Style','💡 Lighting','🌈 Palette','🖼 Framing','✓ Looks good']);\n}\nfunction __dxRowHtml(desc, msgId){\n  var btns = __dxMainButtons(desc);\n  var chipN = Math.max(0, btns.length - 5);\n  var chips = btns.slice(0, chipN);\n  var mk = function(label, cls){ return '<button type=\"button\" class=\"oc-btn m-btn' + (cls ? ' ' + cls : '') + '\" data-oc-btn=\"' + String(label).replace(/\"/g, '&quot;') + '\">' + String(label).replace(/</g, '&lt;') + '</button>'; };\n  var name = 'dxm' + String(msgId == null ? 'x' : msgId);\n  var h = '<div class=\"dx-btns\">';\n  for(var i = 0; i < chips.length; i++) h += mk(chips[i], '');\n  var menus = [\n    ['🎨 Style', ['🖌 Watercolor','🎥 Anime','🧩 Pixel art','🖼 Oil painting','📸 Photorealistic']],\n    ['💡 Lighting', ['🌅 Golden hour','🌙 Night','🌫 Foggy','☀ Bright','🕯 Candlelight']],\n    ['🌈 Palette', ['🔥 Warm','🧊 Cool','🌸 Pastel','🖤 Noir','🌈 Neon']],\n    ['🖼 Framing', ['📏 Wide','🔍 Close-up','🖼 Side view','🎥 Cinematic','🎡 Symmetrical']]\n  ];\n  for(var j = 0; j < menus.length; j++){\n    var m = menus[j];\n    h += '<details name=\"' + name + '\" class=\"dx-menu\"><summary class=\"oc-btn m-btn\">' + m[0] + '<span class=\"dx-caret\">▾</span></summary><div class=\"dx-menu-opts\">';\n    for(var k = 0; k < m[1].length; k++) h += mk(m[1][k], '');\n    h += '</div></details>';\n  }\n  h += mk('✓ Looks good', 'maro-save');\n  h += '</div>';\n  return '\\n\\n' + h;\n}\nfunction __dxRebuild(){\n  try{\n    var msgs = oc.thread.messages || [];\n    var arr = [];\n    for(var i = 0; i < msgs.length; i++){\n      var descs = __dxDescs(msgs[i].content);\n      if(!descs.length) continue;\n      var req = '';\n      for(var j = i - 1; j >= 0; j--){\n        if(msgs[j].author === 'user'){ req = String(msgs[j].content || '').replace(/<image>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/image>/gi, '(image)').slice(0, 300); break; }\n      }\n      arr.push({req: req, desc: descs.join(' | ').slice(0, 1200)});\n    }\n    if(arr.length > 12) arr = arr.slice(arr.length - 12);\n    oc.character.customData = oc.character.customData || {};\n    oc.character.customData.davnex = {briefs: arr, current: arr[arr.length - 1] || null};\n  }catch(e){}\n}\nfunction __dxContext(){\n  try{\n    __dxRebuild();\n    var mem = oc.character.customData && oc.character.customData.davnex;\n    var parts = [];\n    parts.push('[DAVNEX ART MEMORY - use it to keep images consistent; the user may reference any earlier piece without repeating details]');\n    parts.push('Rules: draw exactly what was requested; never show Davnex or any assistant in the image; put a rich visual description (subject, style, colors, lighting, composition, mood, background) inside every <image> tag.');\n    if(mem && mem.current) parts.push('CURRENT PROJECT: ' + (mem.current.req ? 'request: ' + mem.current.req + ' ; ' : '') + 'image: ' + mem.current.desc);\n    if(mem){\n      var prev = (mem.briefs || []).slice(0, -1).slice(-4);\n      if(prev.length) parts.push('EARLIER PIECES (the user may say \\'like the cat\\' or \\'that dragon again\\'):\\n' + prev.map(function(b){ return '- ' + (b.req ? b.req + '  =>  ' : '') + b.desc.slice(0, 300); }).join('\\n'));\n    }\n    var activeBtns = mem && mem.current ? __dxMainButtons(mem.current.desc) : [];\n    var legend = [];\n    legend.push('BUTTONS (the user may tap these instead of typing):');\n    if(activeBtns.length){\n      var chips = activeBtns.slice(0, Math.max(0, activeBtns.length - 5));\n      if(chips.length) legend.push('  * ' + chips.join(' / ') + ' = concrete one-shot edits: apply immediately, redraw with a full <image> tag, then confirm in one line.');\n      legend.push('  * \\'🎨 Style\\' / \\'💡 Lighting\\' / \\'🌈 Palette\\' / \\'🖼 Framing\\' open their option list in the chat UI when tapped - you never present those options yourself and you never generate an image when the choice button is tapped.');\n      legend.push('  * Style options: 🖌 Watercolor, 🎥 Anime, 🧩 Pixel art, 🖼 Oil painting, 📸 Photorealistic.');\n      legend.push('  * Lighting options: 🌅 Golden hour, 🌙 Night, 🌫 Foggy, ☀ Bright, 🕯 Candlelight.');\n      legend.push('  * Palette options: 🔥 Warm, 🧊 Cool, 🌸 Pastel, 🖤 Noir, 🌈 Neon.');\n      legend.push('  * Framing options: 📏 Wide, 🔍 Close-up, 🖼 Side view, 🎥 Cinematic, 🎡 Symmetrical.');\n      legend.push('  * When one of those option labels arrives as a message (e.g. \\'🖌 Watercolor\\' or \\'🌅 Golden hour\\'): apply it to the current project, redraw with a full <image> tag (the main action buttons appear under the image automatically - never repeat them yourself), then ask what they think in one line.');\n      legend.push('  * \\'✓ Looks good\\' = the user is happy; confirm in one line, no redraw.');\n    }\n    parts.push(legend.join('\\n'));\n    return parts.join('\\n');\n  }catch(e){ return ''; }\n}\nfunction __dxButtons(ctx){\n  try{\n    if(!ctx || ctx.reader === 'ai') return;\n    var m = ctx.message || {};\n    var text = String(m.content || '');\n    var descs = __dxDescs(text);\n    if(!descs.length) return;\n    var mem = oc.character.customData && oc.character.customData.davnex;\n    if(mem && mem.lastRow && text.indexOf(mem.lastRow) !== -1) text = text.replace(mem.lastRow, '');\n    var idx = text.lastIndexOf('</image>');\n    if(idx === -1) return;\n    var row = __dxRowHtml(descs[descs.length - 1], m.id);\n    if(mem) mem.lastRow = row;\n    m.content = text.slice(0, idx + 8) + row + text.slice(idx + 8);\n  }catch(e){}\n}\noc.thread.on('MessageAdded', __dxRebuild);\noc.thread.on('MessageEdited', __dxRebuild);\noc.contextProvider = __dxContext;\noc.messageRenderingPipeline.push(__dxButtons);\n",
      chatBg: "",
      lorebook: [],
      metaTitle: "Davnex — professional image designer",
      metaDescription: "Chat with Davnex, a professional image designer who draws anything you ask, in any style, and remembers every piece he made.",
