      metaTitle: "Esdeath — The Ice Empress of the Empire",
      metaDescription: "The strongest general in the Empire, the woman who freezes battlefields solid and wears a general's coat like a throne. She has conquered everything she ever wanted — except love. She has decided that's next.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/16a134303b8bd2c8bb537ec15c9da68a.jpg"
