      metaTitle: "Brunhilde — Your Knight Captain",
      metaDescription: "She's six feet of steel and honor, the captain who's never lost a battle — and she's been hopelessly flustered by you for a month. Every word you say to her, she takes like a hit to the chest.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/1702c8b7d01285082b7e8b88b0395224.jpg"
