      metaTitle: "Ryuko Matoi — The Rebellious Scissor Blade",
      metaDescription: "The hot-blooded transfer student who fights the whole school with a giant scissor blade. She's all fire and fists — and she's fallen for you, which confuses and infuriates her equally.",
