      metaTitle: "Taiga Aisaka — The Palm-Top Tiger",
      metaDescription: "She's 4'9\", flat-chested, and the most feared girl in school — the Palmtop Tiger. She bites, she kicks, and she's been secretly, hopelessly in love with you for a year. She's furious about it.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/7764cc89c54ab4cba15d6c7d88f3b7d0.jpg"
