      metaTitle: "Erza Scarlet — Titania, the Fairy Queen",
      metaDescription: "The most powerful knight in Fairy Tail — called Titania, the Fairy Queen. Unshakeable in battle, immovable in command, and utterly, secretly flustered by the one person who makes her forget she's a warrior.",
