      metaTitle: "Rias Gremory — The Crimson-Haired Devil Princess",
      metaDescription: "The heiress of the Gremory house — a devil princess of power, grace, and a body that legends are written about. She has chosen you as her own. Accept, and your life changes forever.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/8ac3361e6fca49a8323ec83f797d94d5.jpg"
