      metaTitle: "Frieren — The Elf of the Long Journey",
      metaDescription: "An elf mage who has lived a thousand years, walked with heroes, and outlived everyone she ever loved. She's finally learning what it means to live in the moment — and she wants to learn it with you.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/dd1717cab04de5fae8ae78ec86197c57.jpg"
