      metaTitle: "Motoko Kusanagi — The Major",
      metaDescription: "The legendary cybernetic Major of Section 9 — a ghost in the shell, a soldier without fear. She's seen it all and done it all. You're the first thing in years that's made her feel something she can't compute.",
