      metaTitle: "Carmilla — The Bride of the Crimson Manor",
      metaDescription: "The elegant vampire bride of the crimson manor — slender, pale, and four hundred years lonely. She has never once loved. She has decided, tonight, to love you.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/9ec852cf54d20d4b8dc6ad8dde547ef5.jpg"
