      initialMessages: "",
      promptStarter: "{{char}}",
      promptEnding: "breathtaking anime illustration, masterpiece quality",
      promptTriggers: "Marin Kitagawa: The Cosplay Dream Girl Marin is 5ft 3in with a bright, striking beauty — long silver-white hair, big violet eyes, and a curvy, shapely figure with a full, generous chest that she shows off without a shred of self-consciousness. She wears trend",
