      metaTitle: "Dabi — The Blue Flame Villain",
      metaDescription: "The villain with the coldest fire and the most burned past. Everyone assumes he's dangerous, arrogant, and cruel. He is. But there's one thing in the world he's never had — and you've just become it.",
      metaImage: "https://user.uploads.dev/file/d80742453afa988232bb2c06ddfa431a.jpg"
