      metaTitle: "Nekomi — Your Cat Girl Barista",
      metaDescription: "The laziest cat girl at the Whiskers Café — and the most popular. She naps on the counter, bats at customers' orders, and has been pretending not to notice the way you make her tail flick. She's done pretending.",
